WEBVTT

00:00:01.820 --> 00:00:05.000
WRITTEN BY HYUGA NATSU

00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:15.500
THE APOTHECARY DARIES

00:01:29.280 --> 00:01:30.970
THE APOTHECARY DARIES

00:01:31.340 --> 00:01:34.350
‎This story is a work of fiction. The names of all of the characters, organizations, and so on
are imaginary. It also bears no connection to any specific real-life events.

00:01:36.050 --> 00:01:38.220
That whistle! Must be Lihaku.

00:01:38.810 --> 00:01:41.180
So he got Maomao out of the fortress.

00:01:42.100 --> 00:01:43.440
Basen,

00:01:43.520 --> 00:01:45.150
take it easy.

00:01:45.230 --> 00:01:47.360
Then let me go ahead first!

00:01:53.660 --> 00:01:54.950
Wait, step back.

00:01:55.700 --> 00:01:57.580
- Feifa!
- Let’s go!

00:01:57.660 --> 00:01:58.700
Damn it!

00:02:03.620 --> 00:02:05.040
Where is Shishou?

00:02:05.130 --> 00:02:08.960
I don’t know! We were tricked, that’s all!

00:02:09.050 --> 00:02:11.210
Bold of you to say!

00:02:11.300 --> 00:02:14.840
Evidence shows you embezzled national
funds, using them to build this fortress!

00:02:15.720 --> 00:02:17.640
You know what that means!

00:02:18.140 --> 00:02:20.270
We were told, it was for the country!

00:02:20.350 --> 00:02:23.310
We thought it was all for the nation!

00:02:24.770 --> 00:02:27.060
How merciful of you.

00:02:31.360 --> 00:02:33.780
If he is going to be executed anyway,

00:02:34.860 --> 00:02:38.120
- you may as well finish him off cleanly.
- Shishou!

00:02:39.950 --> 00:02:43.620
How relaxed you sound, Shishou.

00:02:45.210 --> 00:02:46.370
By imperial decree,

00:02:47.040 --> 00:02:49.840
you are under arrest
for embezzlement and treason.

00:02:49.920 --> 00:02:55.170
The Forbidden Army is here.
I assumed an edict had been issued.

00:02:55.260 --> 00:02:57.640
Senile, are you?
You do not even have a spark.

00:02:59.180 --> 00:03:00.050
Down!

00:03:04.730 --> 00:03:06.850
How pitiful.

00:03:06.940 --> 00:03:11.070
You used to shoot animals for sport,
itching to try it on a person someday.

00:03:11.150 --> 00:03:15.030
What a pity you never got the chance.

00:03:15.110 --> 00:03:16.200
How disappointing.

00:03:16.280 --> 00:03:17.860
I never said that!

00:03:17.950 --> 00:03:19.660
There's no spark.

00:03:19.740 --> 00:03:23.330
It is a new model.
It can fire without a spark.

00:03:23.410 --> 00:03:25.660
Ah, so you were aware.

00:03:25.750 --> 00:03:27.750
I was attacked with one, after all.

00:03:28.330 --> 00:03:30.590
A pity.

00:03:30.670 --> 00:03:32.550
Had I succeeded then.

00:03:33.590 --> 00:03:35.550
Such a waste.

00:03:37.180 --> 00:03:38.430
So this is it.

00:03:39.220 --> 00:03:41.430
If I had more time.

00:03:42.010 --> 00:03:45.100
No, perhaps nothing would
change regardless.

00:03:45.730 --> 00:03:46.730
What is this?

00:03:47.310 --> 00:03:49.900
He sounds like he is reading
from a prepared script.

00:03:52.650 --> 00:03:53.900
Move in!

00:04:29.690 --> 00:04:34.020
It feels like watching a play
about this man named Shishou.

00:04:37.610 --> 00:04:41.990
A favored retainer since the previous
emperor’s reign, now a traitor.

00:04:42.070 --> 00:04:43.780
It’s anticlimactic, to say the least.

00:04:44.830 --> 00:04:46.490
Such was his end.

00:04:48.370 --> 00:04:50.290
We have not done anything!

00:04:48.900 --> 00:04:52.900
Episode 47: The Shi Clan

00:04:50.370 --> 00:04:52.920
Lady Shenmei and Loulan
are in the back room!

00:04:53.750 --> 00:04:55.710
- I am leaving this to you.
- Yes, Sir!

00:05:01.550 --> 00:05:03.390
- I leave the other side to you.
- Understood.

00:05:17.650 --> 00:05:19.070
Boom!

00:05:20.700 --> 00:05:21.950
Loulan.

00:05:22.030 --> 00:05:24.370
Greetings, Moon Prince.

00:05:24.870 --> 00:05:28.830
No, for convenience,
I shall call you Lord Jinshi.

00:05:30.250 --> 00:05:33.000
Would you be so kind as to follow me?

00:05:33.080 --> 00:05:34.330
And if I refuse?

00:05:34.420 --> 00:05:37.300
That is precisely why I am
threatening you.

00:05:39.210 --> 00:05:41.920
How obedient of you
to come along so willingly.

00:05:42.630 --> 00:05:45.220
You were the one
who told me to follow you.

00:05:45.890 --> 00:05:50.350
But surely, taking this from me
would not be difficult for you?

00:05:54.400 --> 00:05:55.230
This way.

00:05:57.570 --> 00:06:01.240
Sister Suirei,
are they not hurting you anymore?

00:06:02.400 --> 00:06:03.780
So this is Suirei.

00:06:04.660 --> 00:06:08.580
She coaxed the court physician,
faked her death, escaped,

00:06:08.660 --> 00:06:11.580
and returned disguised as a eunuch.

00:06:12.620 --> 00:06:14.870
I always thought her bold.

00:06:16.170 --> 00:06:18.540
Loulan, no. That man is.

00:06:18.630 --> 00:06:22.550
I brought him to fulfil your wish, Mother.

00:06:24.510 --> 00:06:26.680
You have always hated the one

00:06:26.760 --> 00:06:29.010
who resembled this figure, haven’t you?

00:06:29.600 --> 00:06:32.980
Was it jealousy because she was
far more beautiful than you?

00:06:33.770 --> 00:06:38.060
Or was it because he chose an attendant
who was far younger than you?

00:06:39.070 --> 00:06:41.980
Even though you were a senior consort,
he never visited your bedroom.

00:06:42.070 --> 00:06:43.900
Loulan!!!

00:06:44.530 --> 00:06:46.780
Forgive me. That may have gone too far.

00:06:47.570 --> 00:06:51.120
Now then,
before you fulfil your final desire,

00:06:51.200 --> 00:06:53.290
shall we have a little show first??

00:06:55.870 --> 00:06:58.920
This happened more than 30 years ago.

00:06:59.000 --> 00:07:02.710
The late emperor was a dim-witted man,
unable to defy his mother.

00:07:03.380 --> 00:07:07.260
As a result, she wielded true power

00:07:07.340 --> 00:07:09.720
and was called the Empress in the Shadows.

00:07:10.680 --> 00:07:14.730
Tired of her son’s lack of interest
in women,

00:07:15.310 --> 00:07:18.440
she kept sending beautiful women
into the rear palace.

00:07:19.610 --> 00:07:20.900
And then, one day.

00:07:21.730 --> 00:07:22.780
Shenmei,

00:07:23.480 --> 00:07:26.900
is it true you are entering
the rear palace?

00:07:26.990 --> 00:07:29.990
Yes, as a senior-ranking consort,
by request.

00:07:30.070 --> 00:07:32.990
But you were to be, with me.

00:07:33.080 --> 00:07:35.250
That plan is cancelled.

00:07:36.210 --> 00:07:38.920
Do you not understand? This is my chance.

00:07:39.960 --> 00:07:43.500
If I bear the emperor’s child,
the seat of empress could be mine.

00:07:44.010 --> 00:07:46.840
I will not settle for being the wife

00:07:46.920 --> 00:07:48.510
of a northern lord!

00:07:49.970 --> 00:07:51.390
Shenmei.

00:07:51.470 --> 00:07:54.640
She was chosen as
the emperor’s senior-ranking consort.

00:07:54.720 --> 00:07:57.520
But that was merely the official story.

00:07:57.600 --> 00:08:01.230
Official story?
What are you talking about, Loulan?

00:08:01.310 --> 00:08:03.320
I was brought in
as a senior consort by request.

00:08:04.650 --> 00:08:07.650
That was your assumption.

00:08:07.740 --> 00:08:10.410
I heard it from Grandfather
as he lay on his sickbed.

00:08:10.490 --> 00:08:13.120
He kept muttering like a curse,

00:08:13.200 --> 00:08:16.870
"With my daughter held hostage,
I could do nothing."

00:08:16.950 --> 00:08:18.370
Hostage?

00:08:18.460 --> 00:08:23.250
A high official's daughter may be called
a "consort" and taken as a hostage.

00:08:25.670 --> 00:08:29.340
Father once gave up on you,

00:08:29.430 --> 00:08:32.800
but then something unexpected happened.

00:08:32.890 --> 00:08:35.140
The late emperor’s proclivities.

00:08:35.220 --> 00:08:40.100
Lord Jinshi, do you know
why the rear palace became so large?

00:08:40.190 --> 00:08:43.480
I heard Shishou encouraged
the Empress in the Shadows.

00:08:43.560 --> 00:08:46.820
Yes, he proposed expanding the palace

00:08:46.900 --> 00:08:50.030
as a new public project.

00:08:50.110 --> 00:08:51.820
A replacement for the slave trade.

00:08:52.820 --> 00:08:54.280
Slave trade?

00:08:55.620 --> 00:08:59.370
It seems you truly know nothing, Mother.

00:08:59.460 --> 00:09:03.170
Do you even know what Grandfather did
to draw the empress’s attention?

00:09:03.250 --> 00:09:06.000
But back then, slavery was still legal.

00:09:06.960 --> 00:09:10.090
I heard they were treated similarly
to courtesans in the pleasure district.

00:09:10.170 --> 00:09:14.800
But those sold to foreign lands
were different.

00:09:15.390 --> 00:09:19.730
That is why the empress
outlawed the slave trade.

00:09:19.810 --> 00:09:22.730
The Shi family,
whose trade had long been in slaves,

00:09:22.810 --> 00:09:26.770
had no choice but to scale it back after
their daughters were taken as hostages.

00:09:27.400 --> 00:09:30.360
At that time, with no options left,

00:09:30.440 --> 00:09:32.700
Father made a proposal to Grandfather.

00:09:33.530 --> 00:09:35.870
What if we use the rear palace

00:09:35.950 --> 00:09:37.740
as a destination for the remaining slaves?

00:09:38.700 --> 00:09:41.370
Young girls can become maids
or palace women,

00:09:41.460 --> 00:09:44.250
and the boys, eunuchs.

00:09:44.330 --> 00:09:48.920
If we say it is for the emperor,
who has no interest in women,

00:09:49.010 --> 00:09:50.510
the empress may accept it.

00:09:50.590 --> 00:09:53.510
Indeed, families who sold their daughters

00:09:53.590 --> 00:09:55.050
may feel less guilt

00:09:55.140 --> 00:09:58.720
if they enter the rear palace
rather than being sold abroad.

00:09:58.810 --> 00:09:59.810
Exactly.

00:10:00.600 --> 00:10:03.640
It benefits everyone.

00:10:03.730 --> 00:10:07.150
By earning the empress’s trust,
Father hoped to restore

00:10:07.230 --> 00:10:09.320
the Shi clan’s honor,

00:10:09.400 --> 00:10:12.780
and to reclaim you, Mother,
held as a hostage.

00:10:12.860 --> 00:10:14.780
It must have been hard for you.

00:10:15.990 --> 00:10:17.160
Running away earlier

00:10:18.280 --> 00:10:20.490
would have been wiser now.

00:10:26.210 --> 00:10:28.670
Shishou? How did you?

00:10:28.750 --> 00:10:31.710
I made a secret passage. Shenmei,

00:10:32.510 --> 00:10:34.050
will you not come with me?

00:10:35.430 --> 00:10:38.260
If you wish it, let us escape together.

00:10:38.350 --> 00:10:41.600
Escaping from the rear palace
is a capital offense.

00:10:41.680 --> 00:10:44.140
Making a secret passage
is already treason.

00:10:44.730 --> 00:10:47.730
I could never give you up.

00:10:47.810 --> 00:10:50.690
I could not marry anyone else,
and I came this far

00:10:50.780 --> 00:10:52.530
because I wanted to see you again.

00:10:54.950 --> 00:10:57.910
- Are you sure you want me?
- Of course I do.

00:10:59.990 --> 00:11:01.120
Now come.

00:11:09.460 --> 00:11:13.710
Is that the high-ranking consort
who got upstaged by the attendant Taihou?

00:11:13.800 --> 00:11:17.220
Even though she entered before Lady Anshi.

00:11:17.300 --> 00:11:20.350
I hear the emperor has never
visited her chambers, not even once.

00:11:21.470 --> 00:11:22.770
Do not make a fool of me!

00:11:22.850 --> 00:11:25.980
You would have me escape
with that shame lingering on me?

00:11:26.060 --> 00:11:26.940
That is not it!

00:11:27.020 --> 00:11:27.940
Get out!

00:11:30.820 --> 00:11:34.150
Was it that you could not trust a man
willing to throw away

00:11:34.240 --> 00:11:36.240
his own status for you?

00:11:36.820 --> 00:11:40.320
There is no way
I could trust a man like that!

00:11:40.410 --> 00:11:42.870
Right after my father collapsed,

00:11:42.950 --> 00:11:46.210
he took over the clan
and then married this woman’s mother!

00:11:50.040 --> 00:11:51.090
Sister,

00:11:51.170 --> 00:11:52.800
forgive me please.

00:11:57.720 --> 00:12:01.010
That is the phoenix hairpin!

00:12:01.100 --> 00:12:04.470
Yes. As you well know,

00:12:04.560 --> 00:12:06.680
this ornament,

00:12:06.770 --> 00:12:08.350
like the qilin design,

00:12:08.440 --> 00:12:10.690
is only worn by those of imperial blood.

00:12:10.770 --> 00:12:14.780
Lies!
The late emperor never acknowledged her!

00:12:16.110 --> 00:12:19.110
It seems he carried guilt.

00:12:19.700 --> 00:12:23.200
He worried about the baby
he cast out of the rear palace.

00:12:23.280 --> 00:12:26.790
From time to time, he would visit,
aided by Father.

00:12:28.250 --> 00:12:30.250
He once denied it,

00:12:30.330 --> 00:12:32.920
but eventually recognized her
as his daughter.

00:12:33.000 --> 00:12:35.300
And so, he made a request of Father.

00:12:36.170 --> 00:12:39.380
I want you to take my daughter
as your wife.

00:12:40.130 --> 00:12:44.600
Father accepted the child born between
attendant Taihou and the late emperor

00:12:44.680 --> 00:12:46.140
as his wife.

00:12:47.220 --> 00:12:50.310
And eventually,
they had a child of their own.

00:12:51.600 --> 00:12:53.440
We have named her Shisui.

00:12:53.520 --> 00:12:58.030
Shisui, a fine name
for one of the Shi clan.

00:12:58.110 --> 00:13:01.950
Lord, you said you would grant
any wish of mine.

00:13:02.030 --> 00:13:05.780
Then please,
grant me Senior Consort Shenmei

00:13:05.870 --> 00:13:07.950
as a reward.

00:13:08.040 --> 00:13:10.120
When the late emperor saw his grandchild

00:13:10.210 --> 00:13:12.460
bearing the "Shi" name, he was satisfied.

00:13:12.540 --> 00:13:15.130
There was no longer
any need for a hostage.

00:13:15.750 --> 00:13:18.840
And so, Mother, you were given to Father.

00:13:22.340 --> 00:13:25.180
The late emperor was a foolish man.

00:13:25.260 --> 00:13:26.970
He never realized how selfish his wish was

00:13:27.060 --> 00:13:31.770
and how deeply it would affect
the lives of Shishou and his daughter.

00:13:32.350 --> 00:13:33.480
Lies!

00:13:33.560 --> 00:13:35.980
All lies! Don't talk nonsense!

00:13:36.570 --> 00:13:38.190
Nonsense, is it?

00:13:38.280 --> 00:13:41.950
Even though Father did it all for you?

00:13:42.030 --> 00:13:45.160
Knowing there was no salvation
at the end of it?

00:13:49.160 --> 00:13:52.330
Do you not even understand
why Lord Jinshi is here?

00:13:53.870 --> 00:13:56.090
How did Father meet his end?

00:13:57.590 --> 00:13:59.300
He laughed as he said his final words.

00:14:00.420 --> 00:14:03.550
That man only ever wanted power!

00:14:03.630 --> 00:14:07.470
He married me
just to show off his new position!

00:14:08.310 --> 00:14:13.440
And yet, it was you who wielded more
influence than he did within the clan.

00:14:14.060 --> 00:14:19.070
Do you know what your flatterers

00:14:19.150 --> 00:14:20.320
were doing at court?

00:14:20.400 --> 00:14:23.610
You mean the embezzlement
from the treasury?

00:14:23.700 --> 00:14:27.530
Yes. They took bribes,
stole from the national coffers,

00:14:27.620 --> 00:14:30.490
and anyone who dared speak out
was removed.

00:14:30.580 --> 00:14:32.120
All that remained was rot.

00:14:32.870 --> 00:14:36.000
Father took it all upon himself,
acting as the traitor

00:14:36.080 --> 00:14:39.880
to bring down the rot in the Shi clan.

00:14:40.670 --> 00:14:44.720
Lord Jinshi, they called Father a tanuki,

00:14:44.800 --> 00:14:47.890
but tanuki are timid creatures.

00:14:47.970 --> 00:14:51.680
It is precisely because they are timid
that they try so hard to outsmart others.

00:14:52.430 --> 00:14:54.440
If that story is true,

00:14:54.520 --> 00:14:58.440
rear palace expansion and embezzlement
should be judged separately.

00:14:58.980 --> 00:15:03.740
Shishou played the villain, gathering
the nation’s corruption onto himself.

00:15:04.490 --> 00:15:05.700
What a thankless role.

00:15:05.780 --> 00:15:07.950
Did he play the villain

00:15:08.030 --> 00:15:10.080
well enough?

00:15:11.540 --> 00:15:14.290
And do you have proof this is the truth?

00:15:14.370 --> 00:15:18.960
Thanks to this, much of the rot
in the palace has been cleaned out.

00:15:19.040 --> 00:15:21.420
And what if it had not worked?

00:15:21.500 --> 00:15:25.510
Then we would have simply taken
the country as our own.

00:15:25.590 --> 00:15:28.510
If the nation collapses
from this fragility, let it be gone.

00:15:28.590 --> 00:15:30.720
So you were always with him,

00:15:30.800 --> 00:15:32.470
lying to me?

00:15:32.560 --> 00:15:36.480
I only did what you always said, Mother.

00:15:36.560 --> 00:15:40.440
You wanted the country to fall,
did you not?

00:15:42.520 --> 00:15:46.900
Surrounded with fools who only told you
what you wanted to hear,

00:15:46.990 --> 00:15:49.160
did you believe you could
defeat the Forbidden Army?

00:15:49.240 --> 00:15:50.660
Loulan!!!

00:15:54.240 --> 00:15:57.410
Is that not why you had this made?

00:15:57.500 --> 00:16:00.880
It is too much for you to handle.
Give it to me.

00:16:00.960 --> 00:16:02.800
Shut up!

00:16:03.920 --> 00:16:05.050
What is so funny?

00:16:05.670 --> 00:16:07.880
It is just...

00:16:07.970 --> 00:16:10.010
You really are such a small, petty woman.

00:16:10.090 --> 00:16:11.850
Loulan!!

00:16:16.100 --> 00:16:17.480
A gunshot?

00:16:17.560 --> 00:16:18.640
Lord Basen!

00:16:24.360 --> 00:16:26.740
I am a terrible daughter, am I not?

00:16:27.400 --> 00:16:31.490
If I had truly understood my father's
intentions, I wouldn't do this.

00:16:31.570 --> 00:16:34.080
Did you stuff something inside the barrel?

00:16:34.910 --> 00:16:37.620
The newer models are
more complex in design.

00:16:38.120 --> 00:16:42.130
Lord Jinshi, did you never consider
taking it from me then?

00:16:42.210 --> 00:16:45.250
You had plenty of chances.

00:16:45.340 --> 00:16:47.050
You wanted to convey something, right?

00:16:49.050 --> 00:16:51.800
If only you had been
just another pretty fool.

00:16:57.730 --> 00:17:01.310
Mother. Father has died.

00:17:01.400 --> 00:17:03.730
The least you could do is shed a tear.

00:17:04.570 --> 00:17:07.360
He waited for you all this time.

00:17:08.280 --> 00:17:09.950
If you had just shed a single tear,

00:17:10.030 --> 00:17:12.320
even I might not have done
something like this.

00:17:14.530 --> 00:17:17.040
Was there truly no other way?

00:17:17.790 --> 00:17:19.330
Perhaps there was.

00:17:20.000 --> 00:17:22.960
But we were never that clever.

00:17:23.630 --> 00:17:28.510
Shenmei wanted to destroy the country
that scorned her.

00:17:28.590 --> 00:17:32.050
Shishou did everything for her, and yet,

00:17:32.130 --> 00:17:35.800
he was still a loyal subject
who could not turn his back on the nation.

00:17:35.890 --> 00:17:37.220
Lord Jinshi,

00:17:37.930 --> 00:17:39.930
this may sound selfish, but,

00:17:40.020 --> 00:17:42.600
may I ask two things of you?

00:17:44.020 --> 00:17:44.860
What are they?

00:17:45.440 --> 00:17:47.020
Thank you.

00:17:50.030 --> 00:17:51.780
Then, take this.

00:17:56.450 --> 00:18:00.290
To be honest, I meant to use it
as a bargaining chip to beg for my life,

00:18:00.370 --> 00:18:02.250
but it did not go as planned.

00:18:03.000 --> 00:18:04.580
What is written there,

00:18:04.670 --> 00:18:07.590
are the things
that may soon befall this nation.

00:18:09.340 --> 00:18:11.380
This is my first request.

00:18:11.470 --> 00:18:13.720
Those among our clan
who still think clearly

00:18:13.800 --> 00:18:16.100
were exiled by Mother
and have discarded the Shi name.

00:18:16.760 --> 00:18:18.930
My sister is one such person.

00:18:19.640 --> 00:18:22.730
Please, consider them already dead,

00:18:22.810 --> 00:18:24.900
and spare them.

00:18:25.400 --> 00:18:26.520
I will do what I can.

00:18:26.610 --> 00:18:30.940
Then, you will spare the ones
who are "already dead."

00:18:31.530 --> 00:18:33.280
Thank you.

00:18:33.360 --> 00:18:34.530
And the second?

00:18:45.330 --> 00:18:47.420
Now for the second request.

00:19:03.640 --> 00:19:05.190
Thank you.

00:19:05.770 --> 00:19:10.480
Mother, this is all I could do.

00:19:21.490 --> 00:19:24.620
I wonder, could I ever become
a greater actor than Father?

00:21:00.590 --> 00:21:02.720
Should I have stopped her?

00:21:03.430 --> 00:21:06.220
No. I could not.

00:21:06.310 --> 00:21:09.730
The woman reached
her century's greatest villain status.

00:21:10.600 --> 00:21:12.020
I could never destroy it.

00:21:13.310 --> 00:21:16.230
Nor could I look away.

00:21:55.150 --> 00:21:58.940
That was the last time I saw Loulan.

00:22:07.950 --> 00:22:09.620
My body feels heavy.

00:22:09.700 --> 00:22:12.960
Come to think of it,
I have not properly slept in days.

00:22:13.920 --> 00:22:15.080
Where is that girl?

00:22:15.170 --> 00:22:16.420
She is safe.

00:22:16.500 --> 00:22:18.800
More importantly,
you should rest a little.

00:22:19.380 --> 00:22:20.510
Where is she?

00:22:22.380 --> 00:22:23.880
It is best not to get too close.

00:22:30.180 --> 00:22:33.270
They are the children of the Shi clan,
those who died.

00:22:33.350 --> 00:22:35.940
Why are they sleeping here?

00:22:36.020 --> 00:22:39.480
She insisted.
Once she did, none of us could say no.

00:22:40.690 --> 00:22:43.490
Terrible. She looks terrible.

00:22:44.070 --> 00:22:45.740
So do you.

00:22:48.030 --> 00:22:50.240
I knew that if I came back
with a wound on my face,

00:22:50.330 --> 00:22:52.500
my subordinates would be punished.

00:22:53.290 --> 00:22:57.000
And yet, I still granted Loulan’s request.

00:22:57.080 --> 00:22:59.130
It doesn't matter what happens to me.

00:22:59.210 --> 00:23:03.050
Still. It was for the best
that the General was not here to see this.

00:23:03.550 --> 00:23:05.630
Yes, very much so.

00:23:06.470 --> 00:23:07.510
Wait outside.

00:23:15.230 --> 00:23:17.100
If I had not been here,

00:23:17.190 --> 00:23:18.440
she wouldn't have ended up like this.

00:23:28.070 --> 00:23:30.530
What exactly are you doing,

00:23:31.160 --> 00:23:32.290
Lord Jinshi?

00:23:44.130 --> 00:23:45.090
That's...

00:23:46.060 --> 00:24:01.000
